WEBVTT

00:00:41.334 --> 00:00:44.169
Congratulations,
fellow citizens!

00:00:44.170 --> 00:00:47.547
3023 will go down in history

00:00:47.548 --> 00:00:51.218
as the year we
triumphed over COVID-19!

00:00:54.222 --> 00:00:57.474
We interrupt
the triumph over COVID-19

00:00:57.475 --> 00:01:00.644
for a special report.
A new virus...

00:01:00.645 --> 00:01:02.145
- Oh, for Pete's sake.

00:01:02.196 --> 00:01:05.115
- A new virus dubbed EXPLOVID-23

00:01:05.116 --> 00:01:08.994
has broken out among the mutants
who dwell beneath New New York.

00:01:08.995 --> 00:01:12.372
- Symptoms include blinding,
uncontrollable anger!

00:01:12.373 --> 00:01:15.208
As well as a mild cough,
which I don't have. I'm fine.

00:01:15.209 --> 00:01:18.003
- A complete travel ban
to and from the sewers

00:01:18.004 --> 00:01:21.965
is being enforced by the
city's fattest police officers.

00:01:21.966 --> 00:01:24.968
Bye, Mom! Bye, Dad! Love ya!

00:01:24.969 --> 00:01:27.262
- Feh. Always with the love.

00:01:27.263 --> 00:01:30.056
- We already hugged you.
Now, we gotta talk about it?

00:01:32.518 --> 00:01:35.229
- Sorry I'm late. What?

00:01:37.398 --> 00:01:40.735
- Let's move, you sofa
snails! We've got a delivery!

00:01:46.157 --> 00:01:48.116
And now, I'm
proud to present

00:01:48.117 --> 00:01:50.160
the city's highest award,

00:01:50.161 --> 00:01:52.954
the key to the Times
Square liquor cabinet,

00:01:52.955 --> 00:01:56.166
to the super-spreader
of truth himself,

00:01:56.167 --> 00:01:59.002
Bill Nye, the Science Head!

00:02:00.296 --> 00:02:02.297
- Congratulations, Mr. Science.

00:02:03.841 --> 00:02:06.635
Let me just bend that
mic for you.

00:02:07.970 --> 00:02:11.056
- Thank you for this
tremendously dubious honor.

00:02:11.057 --> 00:02:14.267
After what seemed like a
thousand years of COVID...

00:02:14.268 --> 00:02:16.019
- But was actually more!

00:02:16.020 --> 00:02:19.648
- I declare the pandemic
to be officially over.

00:02:26.781 --> 00:02:29.324
- Ugh. Watch where
ya's coughin', bow tie!

00:02:29.325 --> 00:02:30.617
Ow-zers!

00:02:30.618 --> 00:02:32.202
- For crying out loud!

00:02:36.040 --> 00:02:38.792
I'm using the principles
of aerodynamics

00:02:38.793 --> 00:02:40.335
to get the hell outta here!

00:02:45.716 --> 00:02:47.676
Do it again!

00:02:49.554 --> 00:02:51.054
- An anger pandemic?

00:02:51.055 --> 00:02:53.890
Not to point fingers,
but Leela's spreading it.

00:02:53.891 --> 00:02:56.810
I am not, you jerks!

00:02:56.811 --> 00:02:59.730
I'm just running a couple
degrees angrier than normal.

00:03:00.731 --> 00:03:02.983
- Good news, infecter-inos!

00:03:02.984 --> 00:03:05.944
I've developed a test to
see who's got the virus

00:03:05.945 --> 00:03:08.238
and who's just naturally mean.

00:03:08.239 --> 00:03:11.450
You simply jam this
Q-tip up your nose...

00:03:13.369 --> 00:03:15.579
way,
way up your nose,

00:03:15.580 --> 00:03:18.165
and collect a brain
matter sample.

00:03:18.166 --> 00:03:19.583
- That looks kinda fun.

00:03:19.584 --> 00:03:21.835
I can't wait to do
it hundreds of times!

00:03:21.836 --> 00:03:26.298
- Now, we wait for a line to
appear under the two control dots.

00:03:26.299 --> 00:03:28.884
If the line curves
up, you're fine.

00:03:29.886 --> 00:03:31.387
Huzzah!

00:03:32.638 --> 00:03:35.390
Here goes nothin'.

00:03:44.150 --> 00:03:45.942
- This can't be
right, Professor!

00:03:45.943 --> 00:03:48.528
Your test stinks, and
so does your ugly face!

00:03:48.529 --> 00:03:50.280
- Oh no! She's got it!

00:03:50.281 --> 00:03:52.324
- Quarantine her
in the angry dome!

00:03:56.287 --> 00:03:59.414
- Stupid, stinkin', lousy,
no good, son of a...

00:04:01.667 --> 00:04:04.544
- While we don't yet know
how the virus spreads,

00:04:04.545 --> 00:04:06.922
we do know it's anger-based.

00:04:06.923 --> 00:04:10.258
I am therefore issuing
an executive aroo

00:04:10.259 --> 00:04:12.803
that everyone wear a
mask over their ears

00:04:12.804 --> 00:04:16.014
to prevent the transmission
of upsetting remarks.

00:04:16.015 --> 00:04:17.766
Agnew! Come!

00:04:21.771 --> 00:04:24.523
- Mr. President, how could this
possibly be of the slightest...

00:04:24.524 --> 00:04:27.400
- Thanks, fellas. Since I
don't hear any questions,

00:04:27.401 --> 00:04:30.112
this prrress conference
is adjourned!

00:04:30.113 --> 00:04:32.030
- Out of an
abundance of caution,

00:04:32.031 --> 00:04:34.282
all work will
henceforth go remote

00:04:34.283 --> 00:04:36.535
using a new app called Gloom.

00:04:37.370 --> 00:04:39.329
In some ways, it will be better.

00:04:39.330 --> 00:04:41.706
Especially for those
of us with families.

00:04:44.460 --> 00:04:47.254
- Dwight, stop Gloom-bombing
your dad's meeting!

00:04:47.255 --> 00:04:49.256
And put on some britches!

00:04:49.257 --> 00:04:52.592
- Hey, LaBarbara. How's
your grandma? She improvin'?

00:04:52.593 --> 00:04:53.969
- Yeah, she doin' alright.

00:04:53.970 --> 00:04:55.303
Give her my best.

00:04:55.304 --> 00:04:58.056
I'm having
trouble with my... Anybody hear...

00:04:58.057 --> 00:05:00.725
- Wi-Fi issues...
- hungry.

00:05:00.726 --> 00:05:03.311
Bender, you idiot!

00:05:03.312 --> 00:05:05.063
Do you have to eat those now?!

00:05:05.064 --> 00:05:06.940
- I don't have to
eat anything ever.

00:05:08.109 --> 00:05:09.734
- I'm warning you!

00:05:09.735 --> 00:05:12.237
What
are you gonna do?

00:05:12.238 --> 00:05:14.364
Hi... yah!

00:05:14.365 --> 00:05:16.867
- Wow, this technology's
come a long way.

00:05:16.868 --> 00:05:18.994
- I actually like
working on Gloom.

00:05:18.995 --> 00:05:21.080
These hair filters
save a ton of time.

00:05:24.208 --> 00:05:27.252
- Uh-wha...
- Professor, you're a teddy bear!

00:05:27.253 --> 00:05:29.921
I assure you I am not.

00:05:29.922 --> 00:05:31.923
Aw...

00:05:31.924 --> 00:05:35.635
- Is this the Gloom room where
I can refill my prescriptions?

00:05:35.636 --> 00:05:37.888
- No! This is a
delivery company!

00:05:37.889 --> 00:05:40.348
- Can you deliver
my prescriptions?

00:05:40.349 --> 00:05:42.058
- We could, but we won't!

00:05:42.059 --> 00:05:44.269
Oh, this is a dismal failure.

00:05:44.270 --> 00:05:47.022
Everyone report to
the office in person.

00:05:47.023 --> 00:05:50.692
- But, Professor! That is a violation
of health and safety standards.

00:05:50.693 --> 00:05:54.446
- Everything we do is a violation
of health and safety standards!

00:05:54.447 --> 00:05:56.198
Just wear a mask!

00:05:59.619 --> 00:06:02.537
We are dealing with
a highly contagious virus,

00:06:02.538 --> 00:06:05.373
so we'll need to
practice hygiene theater.

00:06:10.630 --> 00:06:14.508
You know, I heard there's
not really even a virus at all.

00:06:14.509 --> 00:06:17.344
It's just a big hoax,
like the moon landing.

00:06:17.345 --> 00:06:19.304
- You were on the
moon last week!

00:06:19.305 --> 00:06:21.181
You grew up on Mars!

00:06:21.182 --> 00:06:23.308
That's what they
want you to think!

00:06:23.309 --> 00:06:26.353
Ugh. Enough with the
conspiracy theories, people!

00:06:26.354 --> 00:06:28.230
Let's look at the facts.

00:06:28.231 --> 00:06:29.606
Irrational rage,

00:06:29.607 --> 00:06:32.109
spread through saliva and spit,

00:06:32.110 --> 00:06:33.944
constant angry moaning.

00:06:33.945 --> 00:06:36.029
It's all the classic symptoms...

00:06:36.030 --> 00:06:37.823
of zombie-ism!

00:06:37.824 --> 00:06:39.783
No way!

00:06:39.784 --> 00:06:43.745
- That's completely unscientific,
Hermes. EXPLOVID victims

00:06:43.746 --> 00:06:47.165
move at way too normal
a speed to be zombies.

00:06:47.166 --> 00:06:49.543
There are all
speeds of zombies out there!

00:06:49.544 --> 00:06:52.462
Fast ones. Slow ones.
Brisk shufflers.

00:06:52.463 --> 00:06:54.881
But the cure is always the same.

00:06:54.882 --> 00:06:56.967
Voodoo.
- Balderdash!

00:06:56.968 --> 00:07:00.804
People stopped believing in
voodoo back in Fry's time.

00:07:00.805 --> 00:07:03.306
But voodoo didn't
stop believing in them.

00:07:03.307 --> 00:07:05.308
Voodoo may not be
well understood,

00:07:05.309 --> 00:07:07.269
but it gets results.

00:07:07.270 --> 00:07:09.020
- You know what
else gets results?

00:07:09.021 --> 00:07:10.480
Public ridicule.

00:07:13.568 --> 00:07:16.153
And yet, there are zombies.

00:07:18.156 --> 00:07:20.365
Oh shoot.

00:07:20.366 --> 00:07:22.200
I forgot to pick up a goat!

00:07:22.201 --> 00:07:25.496
Dwight, go across the hall and
borrow goat from Mrs. Wilson.

00:07:26.080 --> 00:07:28.707
- Pack your bags. We are
going to New New Orleans.

00:07:28.708 --> 00:07:30.709
For Mardi Gras?

00:07:30.710 --> 00:07:32.002
- No. Well, I mean,

00:07:32.003 --> 00:07:34.463
it happens to be Mardi Gras,
but that's beside the point!

00:07:34.464 --> 00:07:36.089
I believe there are people there

00:07:36.090 --> 00:07:38.008
who could defeat
this virus with...

00:07:38.009 --> 00:07:39.342
voodoo.

00:07:40.636 --> 00:07:43.638
Dwight, go to your room right now!

00:07:43.639 --> 00:07:47.434
You are messin' with powers
you don't understand, husband.

00:07:47.435 --> 00:07:50.062
But I do!
- Then come with me, woman!

00:07:50.855 --> 00:07:52.272
- You must listen to me

00:07:52.273 --> 00:07:54.858
'cause I grew up
in a voodoo family,

00:07:54.859 --> 00:07:58.028
and zombie-ism killed my father!

00:07:58.029 --> 00:08:00.031
Then brought him back to life!

00:08:00.490 --> 00:08:03.492
Me don't want anymore
to do with that world.

00:08:03.493 --> 00:08:04.910
- Then I'll have to seek out

00:08:04.911 --> 00:08:07.579
these practitioners of
the dark arts on my own.

00:08:07.580 --> 00:08:10.832
Hopefully, they are near that
place with the good beignets.

00:08:10.833 --> 00:08:13.210
- Be very careful, husband,

00:08:13.211 --> 00:08:15.128
and promise me one thing.

00:08:15.129 --> 00:08:16.671
If you survive,

00:08:16.672 --> 00:08:19.008
you gonna bring me back
some of them beignets!

00:08:29.060 --> 00:08:31.687
- What? It's my
emotional support gun.

00:08:32.438 --> 00:08:35.148
- Which section, sir?
Business or fighting?

00:08:35.149 --> 00:08:38.027
- Uh, the first one.
- Right this way.

00:08:39.070 --> 00:08:41.363
- Hand sanitizer?
- No thanks.

00:08:41.364 --> 00:08:42.864
- Eh, more for me.

00:08:45.243 --> 00:08:46.618
Ma'am? Ma'am?

00:08:46.619 --> 00:08:49.162
Please, don't jam your
husband into the overhead bin.

00:08:49.163 --> 00:08:51.790
- Don't you tell my wife
how to jam me into things!

00:08:51.791 --> 00:08:54.918
- I know my rights.
I'm recording you!

00:08:54.919 --> 00:08:58.797
- And I'm recording you for
recording him without permission!

00:09:04.345 --> 00:09:07.139
- As your mayor, I'm
proud to announce

00:09:07.140 --> 00:09:09.641
that our city's most
prominent egghead

00:09:09.642 --> 00:09:12.102
has developed a
vaccine that will end

00:09:12.103 --> 00:09:15.188
my terrible poll numbers
once and for all!

00:09:16.399 --> 00:09:17.732
- Quite so.

00:09:17.733 --> 00:09:20.694
Thanks to cutting-edge
RNA technology,

00:09:20.695 --> 00:09:24.281
my vaccine is as potent
as it is untested.

00:09:24.282 --> 00:09:27.284
- Ha! My essentially
identical vaccine

00:09:27.285 --> 00:09:28.994
is far superior!

00:09:28.995 --> 00:09:30.871
- Wernstrom.

00:09:30.872 --> 00:09:33.582
- It's a two-shot regimen.
- Oh, yeah?

00:09:33.583 --> 00:09:37.335
Well, mine's three, and it makes
your shoulder sore for a month!

00:09:37.336 --> 00:09:39.796
- Mine makes your arm
shrivel and fall off!

00:09:39.797 --> 00:09:43.175
- Big deal! Mine comes
with a futuristic way

00:09:43.176 --> 00:09:46.762
of knowing exactly who's been
vaccinated and who hasn't,

00:09:46.763 --> 00:09:50.433
a small scrap of easily
lost paper.

00:09:56.022 --> 00:09:57.647
- I made your favorite, Leela.

00:09:57.648 --> 00:09:59.776
Chicken-shaped steak!

00:10:01.486 --> 00:10:04.154
"Wow, this is great, Fry!"

00:10:04.155 --> 00:10:07.240
Is what I'd say if this
pan sauce weren't so bland!

00:10:07.241 --> 00:10:10.577
- Yeah, well, I know that's
just the virus talking.

00:10:10.578 --> 00:10:13.039
How's the cream pie?

00:10:14.040 --> 00:10:17.542
- Scoop Chang, New New Yorker Crossword
Puzzle editor, Smartwatch Edition.

00:10:17.543 --> 00:10:19.669
Dr. Wernstrom, what
do you say to reports

00:10:19.670 --> 00:10:22.339
your vaccine has the
side effect of magnetism?

00:10:22.340 --> 00:10:24.841
That's a feature, not a bug.

00:10:26.385 --> 00:10:28.136
- Linda, Morbo and Linda.

00:10:28.137 --> 00:10:30.514
According to an
anonymous internet post,

00:10:30.515 --> 00:10:33.266
your anti-anger vaccine
causes sterility.

00:10:33.267 --> 00:10:36.061
Care to comment?
- The sterility is essential!

00:10:36.062 --> 00:10:38.980
Studies show that kids are
what make people angriest!

00:10:38.981 --> 00:10:40.482
Everyone hates kids!

00:10:42.652 --> 00:10:44.736
- Am I the only journalist here

00:10:44.737 --> 00:10:47.114
who even bothered to
bring my own facts?

00:10:47.115 --> 00:10:48.782
- Dr. Banjo!

00:10:48.783 --> 00:10:51.493
- Yes, the Dr. Banjo

00:10:51.494 --> 00:10:55.455
of The Dr. Banjo Experience
Podcast Experience Hour.

00:10:55.456 --> 00:10:58.792
Professor Farnsworth, how do you
respond to rumors I'm starting

00:10:58.793 --> 00:11:01.711
that there are 5G
chips in your vaccine?

00:11:01.712 --> 00:11:03.463
- I would simply reassure you

00:11:03.464 --> 00:11:05.257
that the 5G chips are safe

00:11:05.258 --> 00:11:07.592
and purely for
surveillance purposes.

00:11:07.593 --> 00:11:09.428
Dear God!

00:11:09.429 --> 00:11:10.887
- But that's how it works!

00:11:10.888 --> 00:11:13.932
The 5G chips track
the virus particles,

00:11:13.933 --> 00:11:16.226
so the space lasers
can shoot them.

00:11:16.227 --> 00:11:18.603
Keep that quackery away from me!

00:11:31.033 --> 00:11:32.492
- May I take your tray, ma'am?

00:11:32.493 --> 00:11:35.704
- No, you may not
take my dang tray!

00:11:35.705 --> 00:11:38.665
- Ow! Why do we have
to serve shish kabob?

00:11:38.666 --> 00:11:40.834
Hey, don't make me come back there!

00:11:40.835 --> 00:11:43.837
- Sir, please go back to your seat.
- I'm the captain!

00:11:43.838 --> 00:11:46.298
- Don't you pull
rank with me, flyboy!

00:11:46.299 --> 00:11:49.176
Sit your tushy down,
and drive this thing.

00:11:49.177 --> 00:11:50.470
- Tushy my ass!

00:12:01.147 --> 00:12:02.981
This
is the captain speaking.

00:12:02.982 --> 00:12:04.775
Passengers fighting in the
window seats will notice

00:12:04.776 --> 00:12:07.736
we're careening past
scenic Lake Pontchartrain.

00:12:18.289 --> 00:12:21.208
- Help... I can't
move my legs...

00:12:21.209 --> 00:12:23.043
Ooh! I smell gumbo!

00:12:48.361 --> 00:12:51.363
Hello, madam. Is
this the Voodoo HQ?

00:12:51.364 --> 00:12:53.448
- Shh. You do voodoo?

00:12:53.449 --> 00:12:54.950
- You misconstrue.

00:12:54.951 --> 00:12:57.410
Who do voodoo at the HQ?

00:12:57.411 --> 00:12:58.662
- Entendu.

00:12:58.663 --> 00:13:01.790
But such information
won't come cheap.

00:13:01.791 --> 00:13:04.167
- I found this quarter outside.

00:13:04.168 --> 00:13:06.586
Don't worry. I wiped
off most of the vomit.

00:13:08.464 --> 00:13:10.799
- Then let us consult the tarot.

00:13:14.303 --> 00:13:17.013
The Key of Bones,

00:13:17.014 --> 00:13:18.849
the Hanging Man,

00:13:18.850 --> 00:13:22.477
the Man Being Crushed
by a Big Beignet,

00:13:22.478 --> 00:13:26.064
and the Man Being Beaten
by the Saints Mascot.

00:13:26.065 --> 00:13:29.359
Which path do you choose?

00:13:29.360 --> 00:13:30.569
- Hm.

00:13:30.570 --> 00:13:32.654
What's in that pot
under the hanging guy?

00:13:32.655 --> 00:13:34.781
- Boiling gumbo.

00:13:34.782 --> 00:13:36.366
- I'll start with the gumbo.

00:13:39.495 --> 00:13:40.538
Hit me.

00:13:41.038 --> 00:13:42.539
Bam!

00:13:46.252 --> 00:13:48.086
- Mm. Kinda mild.

00:13:48.087 --> 00:13:49.629
Guess I'll try this one instead.

00:13:51.924 --> 00:13:54.801
- This damned
pandemic would be over

00:13:54.802 --> 00:13:57.429
if only people would
take my vaccine.

00:13:57.430 --> 00:14:00.599
Why is everyone
but me so stupid?!

00:14:00.600 --> 00:14:04.311
- Splah. Because everyone
but you uses social media!

00:14:04.312 --> 00:14:06.480
These vaccine fascists

00:14:06.481 --> 00:14:08.315
are taking away our freedom!

00:14:08.316 --> 00:14:10.567
I might as well be
in a cage at the zoo,

00:14:10.568 --> 00:14:12.152
like my aunt!

00:14:12.153 --> 00:14:16.115
- This confounded mask
is destroying my lungs.

00:14:18.451 --> 00:14:21.244
All this
misinformation on Facebag

00:14:21.245 --> 00:14:22.954
is tearing us apart.

00:14:22.955 --> 00:14:24.915
I wonder who's posting it.

00:14:30.338 --> 00:14:31.922
- What else should I post, Dad?

00:14:31.923 --> 00:14:34.007
- Who cares? The
crazier the better.

00:14:34.008 --> 00:14:36.802
Tell 'em worm medicine
helps!

00:14:36.803 --> 00:14:40.013
Those poor, easily
manipulated fools.

00:14:40.014 --> 00:14:42.849
Soon, our time to
invade will draw near!

00:14:42.850 --> 00:14:44.142
- Sounds fun.

00:14:44.143 --> 00:14:47.270
I'll pack my
scream-canceling headphones.

00:14:47.271 --> 00:14:50.315
Lousy,
rotten, tiny angry dome!

00:14:50.316 --> 00:14:52.400
- Leela? I'm really sorry.

00:14:52.401 --> 00:14:54.736
I tried shoving these
flowers where you said,

00:14:54.737 --> 00:14:56.196
but I just couldn't manage it.

00:14:56.197 --> 00:14:57.614
Please take them.

00:14:57.615 --> 00:14:59.699
- Don't come any
closer, you dope!

00:14:59.700 --> 00:15:01.785
You'll get sick and
probably beat up.

00:15:01.786 --> 00:15:05.330
- I don't care. I can't
stand being apart any longer!

00:15:05.331 --> 00:15:06.665
I'm coming in.

00:15:21.848 --> 00:15:24.683
- That fortune teller must
have been jerking my chicken!

00:15:24.684 --> 00:15:26.935
There's nothing
here!

00:15:26.936 --> 00:15:29.604
- Nothing but us bones, mon ami.

00:15:29.605 --> 00:15:31.481
- Sweet andouille of St. Louis!

00:15:31.482 --> 00:15:34.025
A robot made of bones!

00:15:34.026 --> 00:15:36.153
- Je m'appelle Bonebot.

00:15:36.154 --> 00:15:38.321
Been bones-keepin' this boneyard

00:15:38.322 --> 00:15:40.574
for three bone-dred years.

00:15:40.575 --> 00:15:43.827
- Oh good! Because I am
on a bone-related errand.

00:15:43.828 --> 00:15:47.122
I'm looking for a secret
bone key to the Voodoo HQ.

00:15:47.123 --> 00:15:50.542
- Huh. I ain't never
seen no bone key.

00:15:50.543 --> 00:15:53.045
- Have you checked that
prominently displayed skull?

00:15:56.799 --> 00:16:00.302
- Well, huh. Guess I never really
done looked 'round the place.

00:16:00.303 --> 00:16:02.721
Probably 'cause I got no eyes.

00:16:02.722 --> 00:16:05.223
Come on! I'll give you a ride.

00:16:11.063 --> 00:16:13.815
Go on and git from
here, gar fish!

00:16:17.278 --> 00:16:21.031
- That eighth bowl of gumbo
may have been a mistake.

00:16:21.032 --> 00:16:24.326
- No amount of gumbo's
a mistake, mon ami.

00:16:24.327 --> 00:16:26.369
Water's always choppy
in there here parts

00:16:26.370 --> 00:16:28.872
on account of the
force field levees.

00:16:31.209 --> 00:16:34.336
- Y'all see a dugong
from Macon, run him down!

00:16:34.337 --> 00:16:37.088
He absconded with
my daughter's dowry.

00:16:47.850 --> 00:16:49.976
- This place gimme
the heebie-jeebies,

00:16:49.977 --> 00:16:51.937
and not the boogie-woogie kind!

00:16:51.938 --> 00:16:53.730
- You're literally
made of bones!

00:16:53.731 --> 00:16:55.649
- And I aim to keep it that way!

00:16:55.650 --> 00:16:57.860
Bon voyage!

00:17:10.540 --> 00:17:11.706
- Wh-Who goes there?

00:17:15.211 --> 00:17:16.711
Barbados Slim?!

00:17:16.712 --> 00:17:19.840
- People Magazine's
Sexiest Man Alive.

00:17:19.841 --> 00:17:21.216
Come in, Hermes!

00:17:21.217 --> 00:17:23.760
Make yourself feel inadequate.

00:17:33.729 --> 00:17:36.231
Tonight, Earth
is under attack.

00:17:36.232 --> 00:17:40.235
Alien invaders have taken advantage
of our planet's internal divisions

00:17:40.236 --> 00:17:42.404
to launch an all-out
assault.

00:17:42.405 --> 00:17:45.490
Die, you disgusting
freak!

00:17:45.491 --> 00:17:49.454
I just hope I kill
you before those invaders do.

00:17:50.788 --> 00:17:53.123
- All hope is lost. Morbo?

00:17:53.124 --> 00:17:55.208
- They must be destroyed!

00:17:55.209 --> 00:17:57.836
Both sides must be destroyed!

00:17:59.422 --> 00:18:01.339
- I am so sick of you!

00:18:01.340 --> 00:18:02.757
Help!

00:18:02.758 --> 00:18:05.343
- You're the head
of the Voodoo HQ?

00:18:05.344 --> 00:18:08.013
I can't believe it!
- Believe it, man.

00:18:08.014 --> 00:18:10.265
Me studied with the
best of the best.

00:18:10.266 --> 00:18:12.267
She goes by the name of...

00:18:12.268 --> 00:18:14.352
LaBarbara.

00:18:14.353 --> 00:18:16.480
And she was good at voodoo, too.

00:18:18.733 --> 00:18:22.027
- You stay away from her!
She's married to me now!

00:18:22.028 --> 00:18:24.446
You two are mostly
ancient history.

00:18:24.447 --> 00:18:27.157
- History has a way of
repeating itself, brother.

00:18:27.158 --> 00:18:29.701
Now, what brings you here?

00:18:29.702 --> 00:18:31.912
- The virus. I believe voodoo

00:18:31.913 --> 00:18:33.955
might be the only thing
that can fight it.

00:18:33.956 --> 00:18:35.415
- Well, that much is obvious.

00:18:35.416 --> 00:18:38.418
I thought it might be a
form of demonic possession,

00:18:38.419 --> 00:18:40.754
but the tests came
back negative.

00:18:40.755 --> 00:18:42.172
- But consider this.

00:18:42.173 --> 00:18:46.009
My theory is the virus
is a type of zombie-ism!

00:18:46.010 --> 00:18:48.220
- Sweet potatoes of Barbados!

00:18:48.221 --> 00:18:51.139
You don't see a lot of
angry, shouting zombies,

00:18:51.140 --> 00:18:53.100
but it would explain a lot.

00:18:53.101 --> 00:18:56.394
Hermes, you may have
cracked this coconut.

00:18:56.395 --> 00:18:59.022
- Stop naming foods!
Gettin' hungry again.

00:18:59.023 --> 00:19:02.567
- Sadly, curing zombie-ism
is the kind of voodoo

00:19:02.568 --> 00:19:03.985
I don't do.

00:19:03.986 --> 00:19:06.488
There's only one person
with that expertise,

00:19:06.489 --> 00:19:08.532
and I'm afraid...

00:19:08.533 --> 00:19:12.452
- Afraid she might be too sexually
attracted to you to think straight?

00:19:12.453 --> 00:19:14.204
Well,
you're mostly right.

00:19:14.205 --> 00:19:15.288
- LaBarbara?!

00:19:15.289 --> 00:19:18.125
- Hermes, I couldn't
let you do this alone.

00:19:18.126 --> 00:19:21.546
You were brave to come
here, and I love you.

00:19:22.088 --> 00:19:24.422
Well, hello, Barbados.

00:19:24.423 --> 00:19:27.050
- But, how did you find us here?

00:19:27.051 --> 00:19:29.553
And why do you have a
key to Barbados' place?

00:19:29.554 --> 00:19:30.929
- Eh, that's not important.

00:19:30.930 --> 00:19:33.432
- I've also got a
key to your place.

00:19:33.433 --> 00:19:34.683
- Also not important.

00:19:34.684 --> 00:19:38.562
- Come! Follow me to
the inner sanctum.

00:19:45.820 --> 00:19:49.698
What dark,
well-lit sorcery is this?

00:20:01.836 --> 00:20:04.838
- People of Earth! I am Lrrr,

00:20:04.839 --> 00:20:07.632
ruler of the planet
Omicron Persei 8!

00:20:07.633 --> 00:20:09.551
Excuse me.

00:20:09.552 --> 00:20:13.513
I shall rule mercilessly
over your weak and divided...

00:20:14.766 --> 00:20:17.142
That's odd. I've
never sneezed before.

00:20:17.143 --> 00:20:18.477
I don't even have a nose.

00:20:18.478 --> 00:20:21.062
Me neither.

00:20:21.063 --> 00:20:24.274
- Stop interrupting me while I'm
trying to dominate these people!

00:20:24.275 --> 00:20:26.902
- You couldn't dominate
a bowl of fudge!

00:20:26.903 --> 00:20:28.987
Although you sure try!

00:20:28.988 --> 00:20:30.781
- Oh yeah?
- Oh!

00:20:30.782 --> 00:20:32.699
- It's better than that
flavor-free dessert

00:20:32.700 --> 00:20:34.284
- that you serve.
- Is that right?

00:20:35.453 --> 00:20:37.746
Oh, it's
just as I feared.

00:20:37.747 --> 00:20:42.250
The virus has mutated
with Omicronium NDNDNA.

00:20:42.251 --> 00:20:45.462
It's a highly contagious
Omicron variant.

00:20:45.463 --> 00:20:47.088
- You're a contagious variant!

00:20:48.090 --> 00:20:51.551
- Go back where you came
from, you Omi-clods.

00:20:52.804 --> 00:20:55.430
Everyone is so angry.

00:20:55.431 --> 00:20:57.432
Especially me!

00:20:57.433 --> 00:20:59.101
- Ow! My schnookus!

00:21:04.107 --> 00:21:07.109
- Kill all humans!
Kill all humans!

00:21:07.110 --> 00:21:09.152
- Can robots even get the virus?

00:21:09.153 --> 00:21:10.654
What virus?

00:21:13.157 --> 00:21:16.326
- Now, the key is to
produce a voodoo potion

00:21:16.327 --> 00:21:19.287
that tricks the body into
thinking it has the virus,

00:21:19.288 --> 00:21:21.998
but without actually
gettin' the disease.

00:21:21.999 --> 00:21:25.961
- Aha! So, the immune
system falls under its spell

00:21:25.962 --> 00:21:29.381
and produces anti-jujus that
attack the spike protein,

00:21:29.382 --> 00:21:32.259
thus inoculating against
future infection.

00:21:32.260 --> 00:21:33.760
- Precisely.

00:21:33.761 --> 00:21:37.055
You got some serious
mental pecs, husband.

00:21:37.056 --> 00:21:39.182
My second favorite kind.

00:21:40.435 --> 00:21:41.935
- Hey, cut that out!

00:21:41.936 --> 00:21:44.230
Why didn't I get a wink
for my mental pecs?

00:21:45.064 --> 00:21:47.441
- Now, we gonna need
an animal sacrifice.

00:21:47.442 --> 00:21:49.860
I-I mean, um, test subject.

00:21:49.861 --> 00:21:52.904
- Not me.
- I'm too angry!

00:21:52.905 --> 00:21:54.406
- Don't worry, man.

00:21:54.407 --> 00:21:56.533
The doll won't feel a thing.

00:21:56.534 --> 00:21:59.119
- Ow! My calculator arm!

00:21:59.120 --> 00:22:01.037
I just hope
it's got the mojo

00:22:01.038 --> 00:22:03.165
to defeat this anger virus.

00:22:03.166 --> 00:22:04.916
Come, let's run a test.

00:22:08.671 --> 00:22:12.632
- Hm. I just feel a normal,
easy-to-repress rage.

00:22:12.633 --> 00:22:16.178
- Then, perhaps we should
test it a bit more thoroughly.

00:22:17.638 --> 00:22:19.097
- That's enough testing!

00:22:19.891 --> 00:22:23.602
Voodoo shots!
Freshly conjured voodoo shots!

00:22:23.603 --> 00:22:25.104
Ow!

00:22:29.442 --> 00:22:31.485
- Can you assure me
there is absolutely

00:22:31.486 --> 00:22:33.570
no science in this vaccine?

00:22:33.571 --> 00:22:37.449
- Nothing but 100%
Louisiana swamp voodoo.

00:22:42.371 --> 00:22:44.080
Ouchie!

00:22:44.081 --> 00:22:46.416
I was, uh, promised a lollipop.

00:22:46.417 --> 00:22:48.585
Uh, here.

00:22:48.586 --> 00:22:51.588
Mm, tastes a bit
like wig glue.

00:22:51.589 --> 00:22:54.466
What a bunch of mumbo gumbo!

00:22:54.467 --> 00:22:56.885
Anything I can't
understand is fake!

00:22:56.886 --> 00:22:57.969
Ooh!

00:22:57.970 --> 00:23:00.055
Tense

00:23:00.056 --> 00:23:01.723
peaceful

00:23:01.724 --> 00:23:04.017
Ahh, that's better.

00:23:04.018 --> 00:23:05.519
Hermes, my friend.

00:23:05.520 --> 00:23:09.439
I owe you an apology for
being so anti-voodoo.

00:23:09.440 --> 00:23:12.275
It may seem bat-whack
crazy to a layman,

00:23:12.276 --> 00:23:14.778
but I see now that
voodoo methods

00:23:14.779 --> 00:23:18.115
are built on centuries
of brilliant scholarship.

00:23:18.116 --> 00:23:21.493
- It's okay, Professor.
And it's understandable.

00:23:21.494 --> 00:23:24.871
After all, any
sufficiently advanced magic

00:23:24.872 --> 00:23:28.166
is indistinguishable
from science.

00:23:30.670 --> 00:23:33.171
- Ahh yeah...

00:23:33.172 --> 00:23:35.675
uplifting